      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "装备池同时包含神秘戒指、魔法卷轴、刀剑和枪械，让奇幻与火器流派并存",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Arm yourself with a mix of gear, from mysterious rings and magical scrolls, to swords and guns.",
